    "description": "Faiszer Musthapha urges Sri Lanka to seize opportunity amid global instability",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Faiszer-Musthapha-urges-Sri-Lanka-to-seize-opportunity-amid-global-instability/14-789852",
