    "chunk_text": "Lankadeepa FT\u2013Lanka Business TV \u2018Wiyawasayakaya\u2019 business and investment summit in Galle draws 250+\n\nLanka Business TV and DailyFT/Lankadeepa FT concluded a successful edition of its flagship \u2018Wiyawasayakaya\u2019 Business and Investment Summit at the Radisson Blu Hotel, Galle. The event attracted an enthusiastic audience of more than 250 participants including entrepreneurs, aspiring business owners, investors, and members of the public eager to build stronger economic and financial knowledge.\n\nThis summit is part of Lanka Business TV\u2019s nationwide initiative to make practical business education and investment insights accessible to all Sri Lankans.\n\nLanka Business TV Founder and CEO Jayantha Kovilagodage said: \u201cOur mission with \u2018Wiyawasayakaya\u2019 is to empower everyday Sri Lankans with the economic literacy needed to thrive in today\u2019s world. With this being the seventh summit held across various districts \u2014 each met with tremendous public response \u2014 it is evident that there is a strong national appetite for credible, high-value platforms like this.\u201d\n\nThe program featured a powerful lineup of distinguished speakers and experts.\n\nThe event featured a keynote address by CEO advisor and trainer Dr. Ranil Sugathadasa, while Araliya Group Chairman Dudley Sirisena delivered the special guest address. It also included specialist sessions led by NDB Wealth Management Chief Executive Officer Ruwan Perera, Senior Psychological Counsellor and Therapist Chaminda Weerasiriwardena, and Central Bank of Sri Lanka Deputy Director N.A. Aruna Wijesiri.\n\nTopics spanned strategic entrepreneurship, wealth management, macroeconomic trends, and the psychological dimensions of business success, delivering actionable value to all attendees.\n\nThe event also included interactive elements and lucky draws. A standout prize, a return air ticket to Bangkok, was awarded to one lucky participant, adding excitement to the day."
